02:20:09.781 --> 02:20:12.013
Eagle Mountain as a believer city.

02:20:12.912 --> 02:20:17.070
Whereas Eagle Mountain City, Utah recognizes that strong communities

02:20:17.167 --> 02:20:20.041
are built not only through infrastructure and public services,

02:20:20.796 --> 02:20:24.986
but also through the values that unite neighbors, strengthen relationships,

02:20:25.115 --> 02:20:28.871
and inspire civic participation. And whereas

02:20:28.983 --> 02:20:32.335
the Believer City Initiative associated with the Show Me

02:20:32.415 --> 02:20:36.168
a Sign organization encourages communities to lead with belief

02:20:36.424 --> 02:20:39.952
as a shared civic value by fostering encouragement,

02:20:39.968 --> 02:20:42.662
connection, and hope across public spaces,

02:20:43.240 --> 02:20:45.100
civic institutions, and community life.

02:20:46.046 --> 02:20:49.285
And whereas the City Council recognizes the importance

02:20:49.414 --> 02:20:52.846
of cultivating a community where residents feel valued,

02:20:52.974 --> 02:20:57.243
supported, and connected and where people actively invest belief

02:20:57.452 --> 02:21:01.274
in one another. And whereas Eagle Mountain City desires to

02:21:01.290 --> 02:21:04.485
promote a culture in which residents are encouraged

02:21:04.598 --> 02:21:08.034
to support one another, contribute positively to community

02:21:08.534 --> 02:21:12.225
life, and help ensure that every person knows they

02:21:12.725 --> 02:21:16.320
matter. Now therefore, Mayor Jared Gray and

02:21:16.820 --> 02:21:20.158
the Eagle Mountain City Council do hereby proclaim that Eagle

02:21:20.658 --> 02:21:23.707
Mountain City is hereby designated A believer city.

02:21:24.494 --> 02:21:28.492
And Eagle Mountain City affirms its commitment to: 1,

02:21:28.604 --> 02:21:31.783
promote encouragement, connection, and hope throughout the community.

02:21:32.442 --> 02:21:36.038
2, explore opportunities to make belief visible

02:21:36.392 --> 02:21:38.848
in appropriate public settings and community activities.

02:21:39.426 --> 02:21:43.007
3, support initiatives that inspire residents to

02:21:43.055 --> 02:21:47.519
invest belief in one another. 4, encourage civic engagement

02:21:47.858 --> 02:21:51.889
and community pride through positive action and service. And 5,

02:21:52.488 --> 02:21:56.082
foster a culture that reminds individuals they are

02:21:56.276 --> 02:22:00.330
valued, supported, and capable of making

02:22:00.475 --> 02:22:03.773
meaningful difference. Dated this 7th day of July,

02:22:03.950 --> 02:22:04.994
2026.

02:22:07.227 --> 02:22:10.633
