02:22:36.738 --> 02:22:40.076
pretty exciting for us. So as we grow, I want to

02:22:40.392 --> 02:22:43.796
continue to promote this kind of, uh, brotherhood, if you will,

02:22:44.390 --> 02:22:47.296
in our city. So I think that's what makes us unique.

02:22:48.099 --> 02:22:51.471
