03:13:37.115 --> 03:13:40.574
So it was giving them time to actually complete the development afterwards.

03:13:42.360 --> 03:13:45.541
That's consistent with our code, which allows for 2 2-year extensions of an

03:13:46.041 --> 03:13:46.087
MDA.

03:13:51.149 --> 03:13:55.313
