03:15:09.847 --> 03:15:12.811
would have to start the site work. Site work doesn't make a lot of sense.

03:15:13.709 --> 03:15:16.913
So it naturally makes sense to extend the agreement somewhat so

03:15:16.978 --> 03:15:20.494
