03:15:36.119 --> 03:15:39.598
I was just going to say, so we— this started in 2023?

03:15:40.274 --> 03:15:43.318
Yes, when all this got started. And that's when it was signed.

03:15:43.737 --> 03:15:49.681
We're contemplating going to 2033.

03:15:49.730 --> 03:15:50.809
