is that you're stating to us we can get started,

03:17:18.649 --> 03:17:22.364
we have the capability of doing our project. That's the understanding that

03:17:22.864 --> 03:17:26.241
any council would have in looking at a development agreement. Well,

03:17:26.289 --> 03:17:29.394
it's been 3 years and nothing's

03:17:29.894 --> 03:17:32.021
happen still. And there have been a lot of other circumstances that you've, you've set

03:17:32.521 --> 03:17:36.183
up there. Some of those are financial decisions that you've decided not to go forward

03:17:36.683 --> 03:17:38.866
in hopes that somebody else will be a participant or that they would build it

03:17:39.366 --> 03:17:42.803
and that would reduce your costs. And we understand those things, but according

03:17:43.303 --> 03:17:47.109
