03:20:29.974 --> 03:20:32.906
So I guess I never saw us in that general in the general plan in

03:20:32.939 --> 03:20:35.596
the town center area. Yeah, that's the first time I'm hearing that we're even in

03:20:36.096 --> 03:20:39.598
