04:13:37.094 --> 04:13:37.129
applicable.

04:13:39.032 --> 04:13:42.905
And so safety and risk

04:13:43.405 --> 04:13:47.697
mitigation and environmental concern

04:13:47.826 --> 04:13:51.392
is of the most priority of the NRC

04:13:51.892 --> 04:13:55.566
and any other regulatory body. And so the way that they are looking at

04:13:56.066 --> 04:13:59.500
those different things is trying to make sure that they're not

04:14:00.000 --> 04:14:03.466
necessarily a barrier or a complication for

04:14:03.611 --> 04:14:07.239
