04:14:07.914 --> 04:14:11.960
a number of standards or a number of different requirements and things like that that

04:14:12.490 --> 04:14:15.801
are based on technologies or based on science that is no longer

04:14:15.818 --> 04:14:19.472
in use. And so there's been enhancements to

04:14:19.972 --> 04:14:23.874
efficiencies. The way that the chairman of the NRC described it basically

04:14:23.906 --> 04:14:27.361
